<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - RAKVERE TO ISSUE BONDS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - RAKVERE TO ISSUE BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rakvere Meat Factory said on Friday it will issue 11.25 million marks in one year bonds to finance its acquisition of the majority of shares in Latvia's Rigas Miesnieks.</p>
<p>The bonds will yield seven percent and their nominal value is 10,000 marks, it added in a statement.  </p>
<p>The issue, organised by Uhispank, will take place on July 28.</p>
<p>Rakvere signed the agreement to buy 67 percent of Latvia's largest meat producer on May 14. It said earlier it will pay 103 million kroons for the shares.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
